      "text": "There is a shadow market out there that is bigger than the stock market bigger than the bond market and makes the entire crypto market look like loose change found under a couch cushion Overnight, this single market can spike the price of oil, vaporize billions of dollars from corporate profits, ruin your summer holiday budget, and make entire nations either filthy rich or dangerously vulnerable.",
